<title>USA: North Central Bancshares sets buyback.</title>
<headline>North Central Bancshares sets buyback.</headline>
<dateline>FORT DODGE, Iowa 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Central Bancshares Inc said Thursday it received approval for its initial stock repurchase program, authorizing the buyback of up to five percent of its 4,011,057 outstanding shares over six months.</p>
<p>Purchases will be made from time to time in open market transactions at the discretion of management.</p>
<p>North Central is the holding company for First Federal Savings Bank of Fort Dodge.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
